===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=kolìko}}

# {{lb|sh|interrogative}} [[how much]], [[how many]]
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Koliko''' imaš vremena?|How much time do you have?}}
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Koliko''' je sati?|What time is it?}}
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Koliko''' puta?|How many times?}}
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Koliko''' dugo?|(For) How long?}}
# {{lb|sh|in comparisons|formal|preceded by '''{{m|sh|onoliko}}'''}}  [[as]], as much/many as
#: {{uxi|sh|Kupite onoliko igračaka '''koliko''' je djece.|Buy as many toys as there are children.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|On je skoro onoliko visok '''koliko''' i ja.|He is almost as tall as I am.}}
# {{lb|sh|with generalization particle '''{{m|sh|god}}'''}} no matter how much/how many
#: {{uxi|sh|'''Koliko god''' mu daš, nikad nije dosta!|No matter how much you give him, it's never enough!}}
